window.products.push({"id":507311,"name":"Nymphia Spring Pillow Covers 18x18, Pink Watercolor Floral Decorative Throw Pillows for Couch Sofa Bed, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xpm9iDWyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Velvet Decorative Spring Couch Pillow Covers: (NOT INCLUDE PILLOW INSIDE) Set of 2 throw pillow covers, 18 x 18 Inch. Premium Material: Made of top-grade polyester. The fabric is not only more durable than traditional material, but also free from fade, stain, and wrinkle, and harmless to skin. Widely Application: A must-have for room decoration, suitable for all kinds of occasions: couch, sofa, bed, living room, and bedroom, also perfect to use as a gift for family and friends. Design: Invisible zipper makes the appearance simple and beautiful, this watercolor floral collection pillows aid a splash of color and natural beauty to your bed or sofa. Washing Tips: Machine Wash Cold Separately. Gently Cycle Only. Do Not Bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Do Not Iron and it'll look brand new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xpm9iDWyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nymphia","source_asin":"B09TZNHD98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TZNHD98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TZNHD98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":507312,"name":"LUHAH Personalized Pet Blankets with Name, Custom Dog Throw Blankets, Customized Photo Blanket for Adult, Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716PfdYKI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEPS YOU WARM ALL SEASONS   Our super-soft, plush microfiber blanket is perfect for use all year round. And all of our custom blankets offers the right balance of cozy and style to make sure that you don't just stay comfortable but also uplifts the look of your Sofa, Couch, Bedding, Car, Bedrooms, Living Rooms and Offices.  HOW TO CUSTOMIZE?   1. Choose the size of blanket you want;  2. Click \"Customize Now\" and Follow the process;  3. Upload your text on the blanket;  4. Add to cart and finish it!   PRODUCT FEATURES:   - Made of 100% polyester microfiber, so that can make the flannel blanket more softer and comfortble. When you put it on your body, you can feel the warmth brought by the blanket, just like hugging your love.  - Personalized present for your mom, dad, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, boyfriend, girlfriend, daughter, son, sister, family, friends, kids, pets, cats or dogs lover. A thoughtful present that will touch your heart while wrapping them in your good thoughts and memories.  - It's wonderful experience when surround yourself with customized blankets while watching TV series with a mug of hot chocolate on couch, especially on chilly nights.   NOTE:   1. It is recommended to upload high-resolution photos. High-quality texts can make you have the most perfect blanket. The higher the better.  2. If you don't know how to upload the photo, just take an order and send us the photo and word by email, we can do it for you.  3. Our delivering time is usually takes 2-3 days for production, 7-15 days for standard delivery. It is Peak time during festival, please take order as earlier as passable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716PfdYKI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUHAH","source_asin":"B09KFXBSSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KFXBSSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KFXBSSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
