window.products.push({"id":507399,"name":"Brita Cool Graphit Marella Water Filter Jug Maxtra+, Fridge Fit Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xe4-+rGsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRITA Marella Water Filter and 1 MAXTRA+ Filter Cartridge The Marella jug comes in a wide variety of colours including limited edition designs and also a choice in size to help match your kitchen style. Featuring MAXTRA+ filter with MicroFlow technology, impurities from tap water are reduced to leave great-tasting water for drinking, brewing tea and coffee and preparing meals. The Marella jug is a cost-efficient and environmentally conscious alternative to transporting and storing plastic bottled water at home. Product information: The MAXTRA+ filter reduces substances that alter the taste and smell of water, such as chlorine and limescale. It also helps reduce the amount of heavy metals that may be present in water due to domestic piping systems The MAXTRA+ filter reduces substances that alter the taste and smell of water, such as chlorine and limescale. It also helps reduce the amount of heavy metals that may be present in water due to domestic piping systems Full volume: 2.4 Litre, filtered water capacity: 1.4 Litre Full volume: 2.4 Litre, filtered water capacity: 1.4 Litre 1 MAXTRA+ filter cartridge is good for 1 month or 100 Litre of fresh water at home or the office 1 MAXTRA+ filter cartridge is good for 1 month or 100 Litre of fresh water at home or the office Jug measurements: 25.6 x 25.85 x 10.4 cm Jug measurements: 25.6 x 25.85 x 10.4 cm Fridge fit Fridge fit Cartridge colour: White, jar colour: Transparent, lid colour: Cool graphite Cartridge colour: White, jar colour: Transparent, lid colour: Cool graphite All materials that come into contact with water are BPA-free All materials that come into contact with water are BPA-free Instructions Insert the cartridge into the funnel. Fill with water and do not use the first two fillings. To better activate the filter material, make sure you use the filteredwater from the third fill onwards. The filter cartridge should be replaced after 4 weeks or 100 Litre. About BRITA In the 60s, Heinz Hankammer founded the company BRITA, inspired by his daughter’s name. The idea behind it: Optimise tap water. First for car batteries and soon after for home use. In 1970, he launched the first water filter jug and patented it. What started as production in his own garden developed over the course of 50 years into an international company.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xe4-+rGsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brita","source_asin":"B076HFS3KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076HFS3KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076HFS3KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
