window.products.push({"id":507447,"name":"Urban Apothecary Verbena Leaves Little Luxury Scented Candle 70 g","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613xFh-FZqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A sparkling scented memory reliving the moment of sipping zingy verbena tea, eyes wild with delight at the lemony surprise. Verbena Leaves transforms any mood with its sunny disposition, it’s cheerily vibrant! A respected cure-all, verbena is a super-herb. That’s why in our aromatic apothecary we place it at the centre of this fragrance as an antidote to the blues. This refreshing and revitalising Verbena Leaves scented candle is like a butterfly bursting from chrysalis. The scent of verbena leaf crushed between finger and thumb is transformative. Notes of verbena, lemongrass and zest of chilled citrus need no coaxing to create a crescendo of lemon-scented leaves, stems and fruits. In subtle support, a woody accord of cedar, sandalwood and patchouli lends a hint of earthy naturalness and the fresh outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613xFh-FZqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Apothecary London","source_asin":"B07KQXT1HZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KQXT1HZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KQXT1HZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":507448,"name":"Sacred Desert Stones Amethyst Candle Holders - Natural, Raw, Purple Holder Crystals, Geode Stone Holder, Crystal Cluster (Medium)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HiqyoV+4L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Every Amethyst Healing Stone Holder is inspected and finished by hand at our facility in Scottsdale, AZ. We securely package and ship directly to you from Arizona. Only the highest quality quartz candle holder stones are accepted and sold in our store. We never source or manufacture in China! All of our naturally occurring gemstone candle stones are mined at our partner locations in Brazil, Uruguay and the United States. High quality and craftsmanship you can count on. Since every candle holders stone is manufactured by Mother Nature over millions of years, there is a natural element and uniqueness to all amethyst rocks. We always try to represent the wide selection of stones we sell, but please consider that your specific item may vary slightly from what is represented in our photos. Our US-based team is always here to help so please reach out directly to SACRED DESERT STONES if you have any questions or concerns about your product. The Amethyst crystal glitters across the color spectrum; this purplish stone can be pale pink in hue or deep and violet. One purple tea light stone can display a host of varying shades and is considered to be one of the most beautiful crystal quartzes in the world. Amethyst is one of the best crystals to use as a meditation aid. For those who need healing clarity in your home or office, Amethyst is your answer. Placing the stone near your workspace can help reduce stress and ease the overwhelming feelings that come with daily life. Focus and re-center the mind for better concentration, reduced procrastination, and increased inspiration. Amethyst can be used in the home to help build upon the free flow of Feng Shui and is a beautiful balancing tool. Placed in the office it helps inner creativity while placed in the bedroom nurtures deep soulful sleep. Placing in communal areas of the home absorbs strains of negativity and transmutes these energies into positive vibrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HiqyoV+4L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sacred Desert Stones","source_asin":"B09K36PRX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K36PRX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K36PRX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
