window.products.push({"id":507535,"name":"BLISS - Small Natural Light LED Eye-protection Multi-function Desk Lamp, 3 Lighting Modes- Studying, Reading and Relaxation / Bedtime, 5- Level Bright","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HnqkBGQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BLISS Light LED Desk Lamp is the ideal energy-saving and eco-friendly LED desk lamp, with its multi-function purposes, it can be used as a reading lamp, a piano lamp, a night light, or a general purpose desk lamp for your choice. It adjusts the brightness and the color temperature by touch pad easily, is an irreplaceable lamp that will save you in energy cost. 3 Distinct Lighting Modes *Cold Light Environment(Studying Mode): increases attention & concentration with high-range color temperature (5500K-7000K) *Natural Light Environment(Reading Mode): stimulates concentration & reduces eye strain with mid-range color (4300K-5300K) *Warm Light Environment(Relaxation/Bedtime Mode): encourages a deep sleep with comfortable soft light (2500K-3300K) Specification *Power supply: DC 5V 1A *Input Voltage: 100-240VAC, 50/60Hz *CRI: >80 *Max Luminous: 800 LUX *Switch Way: Touch switch *Light Way: Vertical light *Working Temperature: <50 Centigrade Color Temperature *Product Size: H550MM*L150.5MM*W150.5MM *Product Net Weight: 710g Package includes *1 LED Desk Lamp *1 Power Adapter *1 Instruction Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HnqkBGQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLISS","source_asin":"B00LDMGBQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LDMGBQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LDMGBQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":507536,"name":"TeChef - Casa Verde 8\" Frying Pan, Coated 5 times with Teflon Select Non-Stick Coating (PFOA Free) (8 IN (20 cm))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vlP8nIraL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TeChef offers non-stick and durable cookware which makes cooking Healthy Food for a Healthy Family easy, fun and environmentally safe. COATED 5 TIMES with PRINT DESIGN TECHNOLOGY While many other cookware products offered by other manufacturers involve only a 3 layered internal non-stick coating (primer, mid-coat and top-coat), TeChef cookware includes a non-stick coating in 5 layers and is based on Select grade Teflon technology without PFOA. The additional 2 layers of non-stick coating allows the TeChef cookware to be uniquely designed and decorated using Teflon Print Design technology, an innovative and safe method of applying color and prints without the use of harmful external paints. SAFE NEW TEFLON COATING (NO PFOA) The non-stick coatings without PFOA on TeChef products are affirmed safe for cooking by regulatory agencies worldwide, including the European Food Safety Authority, French Food Safety Agency (ANSES), the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA), and the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA). INDUCTION-READY HEAVY-BASE In contrast to cookware with a uniform thickness, TeChef incorporates a forged aluminum material with thin walls and 3.5 mm thick and heavy bottom. This unique design helps spread the heat evenly across the bottom of the pan and all the way up the sides. The TeChef cookware can be used with all types of ranges, and the unique design makes it compatible with Induction cooktop as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vlP8nIraL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TECHEF","source_asin":"B00GMDNBGE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GMDNBGE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GMDNBGE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
