window.products.push({"id":507680,"name":"EC Homelife Mini Dehumidifier for Piano, Renewable Small Dehumidifier for Basement, Wardrobes, Closet, Cordless Safe Rechargeable Moisture Absorber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W+ioQWYkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIAL FOR PIANO USE: Silent Operation --- This piano dehumidifier has a mute dehumidification function, so that you can practice the piano without interruptions. No Heat --- Our products will not generate heat during operation and will not affect the temperature inside the piano. Without Damaging the Piano Structure --- Traditional piano dehumidifiers need to punch the fixing screws in the piano. This dehumidifier can be used directly under the piano without damaging. Energy Saving --- Compared to the traditional 25W piano dehumidifier, which must be charged when in use, our dehumidifier is more energy saving and does not need to be electrified when in use. FEATURES: - Safe Silica Gel Crystals: This mini dehumidifier will quickly and efficiently absorb moisture from the air without any troublesome leaks or spills, give you a dry and fresh air. - Reusable: When the dehumidifier is full, the beads will turn green, you can renew the silica inside by plugging it into any power outlet. The heat will release water vapor in a few hours. When the silica beads turn orange again, the machine is ready to go back to work. - 100% Cordless: No cables or batteries required. Just get your small dehumidifier fully charged and say bye-bye humidity! - Energy Saving: Long service life, the longest service life is about 10 years. SPECIFICATION: Product Dimensions: 19 x 4 x 12.5 cm / 7.5 x 1.6 x 4.9 inches Package Size: 22 x 16.5 x 8 cm / 8.7 x 6.5 x 3.1 inches Material: ABS Power: 25W ± 10% Dehumidifying Material: SiO2 Applicable Scene: Study, piano room, wardrobes, closets, RV, cars, etc. Saturation Dehumidification: 250 ml Item Weight: 1.0 kg PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1x Rechargeable Mini Dehumidifier","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W+ioQWYkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EC Homelife","source_asin":"B08KZV98MT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZV98MT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZV98MT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":507681,"name":"Set of 20 Assorted Colors Mini Ritual Chime/Altar/Spell Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PWs8OVx2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These genuine Biedermann & Sons candles are some of the highest quality Chime/Altar/Spell candles available. Whether you're creating the atmosphere within your sacred space or home or using them in rituals of candle magic and other spells, prayers, or blessings, these Biedermann unscented chime candles are a wonderfully versatile magical tool for your altar. You will receive 20 candles of assorted colors (2 candles each of 10 different colors). Coming 20 to a pack, these party/chime/altar/spell candles stand approx. 4\" tall and 1/2\" in diameter, burning for an average of 2-2.5 hours. To prevent fire and serious injury: Burn candle within sight. Keep away from drafts and vibrations. Keep out of reach of children and pets. Never burn candle on or near anything that can catch fire. Please note, these will only fit chime candle holders (smaller than a standard taper).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PWs8OVx2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biedermann & Sons","source_asin":"B00J516ZAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J516ZAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J516ZAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
