window.products.push({"id":507683,"name":"Litanika Grey Quilt Queen(90x90Inch), 3 Pieces (1 Gray Dot Quilt and 2 Pillowcases) Lightweight Bedspread Coverlet, Soft Microfiber Quilted Bedding Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AnZ8T-SZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LIGHTWEIGHT & DURABLE】Always wake up on hot summer night and hard to fall asleep? Do not worry, Litanka dot quilt set is coming! Filled with premium microfiber filler, Litanika quilt set works effectively in retaining body heat without feeling overheated. The quilt is lightweight, but not too thin, it's perfect for temperature regulating needs and suitable for all seasons - As a quilt used alone in the warmer months, as a bedspread/coverlet for extra warmth and comfort during the cold months. 【SOFT & COZY】Have you ever imagined lying in a soft cloud to sleep? Now, Litanika queen quilt set brings you this experience. Made of comfy brushed microfiber, our bedspread is comfortable and breathable. By treating the fabric at the molecular level, it maximizes softness and breathability, which will gently stimulate your whole body for a better sleep and relaxation. Good air permeability makes the quilt fit for different skin types and lets you wake up refreshed every day. 【UNIQUE & HIGH QUALITY】Adopts advanced sewing technology and neat and strong stitches, making Litanika coverlet set more durable than those ultrasonic printing quilts. Features geometric stitched design in both sides, ensuring an even distribution of filling without bunching or moving. Detailed dot-quilted all over the gray quilt, simple yet stylish, easily enhance the look of your bedroom, guest room, kids room or vacation home. 【VERSATILE USAGE SCENARIOS】Litanika grey quilt set is perfect for indoor, outdoor activities and anywhere you need a comfortable bedspread. You can enjoy it while resting, watching TV, taking a nap or enjoying outdoor activities. Also, you could use it for any cabin like lake house, mountain house, cottage or lodge. If you want to choose a thoughtful gift for your friends and family members on special days like birthday or holiday, Litanika quilt set will be a perfect choice. 【PACKAGE INCLUDES & EASY CARE】Our coverlet QUEEN size includes 1 Circle Quilt(90x90 inch) and 2 Envelope Pillowcases(20x26 inch). Machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Tumble dry with low heat or air drying. Do not bleach or iron. Due to the use of vacuum packaging, before first use, it is strongly recommended putting the quilt in the sun for more exposure and lightly pat a few times so that it will be more fluffy and soft.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AnZ8T-SZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Litanika","source_asin":"B0943CL3VG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0943CL3VG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0943CL3VG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
