window.products.push({"id":507754,"name":"Two King Size Soft Conforming 4 Pound Density Visco Elastic Memory Foam Contour Pillows Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21GLmGjW2UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Memory foam's ability to reduce pressure points is one of the reasons so many people are using it to get the best night's sleep. Now you can enjoy the benefits of two open cell visco elastic memory foam contour neck pillows like the leading brand at a fraction of the cost. The ergonomic contoured shape with dual lobes was engineered through a collaboration of doctors, chiropractors and sleep professionals to promote proper cervical alignment and support. These contour neck pillows will add comfort and help increase the quality of sleep increasing cranial blood flow and reducing painful pressure points caused by flat pillows. The open cell four pound density memory foam used in these pillows is specifically designed to enhance spinal alignment and also provides additional support in areas where your head, neck and shoulders may be dipping or sagging without proper support. The foam is also specially formulated to contour to your body’s temperature and will give you the extra comfort you need to get the best night's sleep possible when you replace your current ordinary pillow. Our pillows have also earned the PURGreen certification, which means they are manufactured, fabricated and packaged in the U.S.A. meeting all EPA and CSPC standards being safe and free from harmful chemicals. PURGreen uses independent laboratory results to qualify products and ensure they are manufactured without the use of ozone-depleting substances such as Chlorofluorocarbons, Polybrominated Biphenyl Ether substances, Harmful Metals, Formaldehyde, Prohibited Phthalates or any other unsafe materials. PURGreen also implements baseline requirements such as conserving water, energy and other natural resources in the manufacturing processes established through internationally accepted ISO standards and procedures. There may be a new foam smell associated with your new pillow; however, this odor is not toxic or harmful passing all PURGreen, EPA and CSPC standards. MADE IN THE USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21GLmGjW2UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Memory Foam Solutions","source_asin":"B00CEBS0IM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CEBS0IM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CEBS0IM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
