window.products.push({"id":507805,"name":"WINSDOM Aluminum Nonstick Tagine Pot Moroccan for Cooking 11 Inch Casserole Dutch Oven with Cone-shaped Lid Induction Nonstick Cooking Pots and Pans D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x3fUGMSSS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MAGIC COOKING: The traditional Tagine pot Moroccan is a fantastic cooker to cook food tenderly and brings out its natural flavors with its special structure. The rising steam condenses on the cone-shaped lid and drops back onto the food gently to help boost the taste of the food cooked. Less seasonings needed. Enjoy the traditional Moroccan recipe. MATERIAL: Cast aluminium base and lid makes it much lighter than cast iron or ceramic tagines and easier to carry especially when it has food inside, while still strong enough to be a durable and reliable cookware for various recipes. NONSTICK MULTIFUNCTIONAL PAN: Non-stick coating technology applied on the tagine which enables it not only to deliver traditional Moroccan style dishes, but also to serve as a casserole, stewing pot, sauté pan or even a frying pan. EASY TO CLEAN. INDUCTION COMPATIBLE: The induction bottom could be used on all stove cookers and hobs: gas, halogen, ceramic and electric stoves. Dishwasher safe. ANTI-SCALDING DESIGN: The knob and the handles are made of bakelite to prevent scalding. You can easily and safely hold the pan and open the lid while or after cooking. It is not suitable for oven, as bakelite is not oven safe, UNLESS you remove the knob and the handles easily with a screwdriver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x3fUGMSSS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINSDOM","source_asin":"B08L39NB5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L39NB5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L39NB5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
