window.products.push({"id":507855,"name":"Clean The World Evoline Single (18oz) Chamber Shampoo Dispenser - White ABS - Pre-Filled Squeeze Bottle with Bracket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aM2qBIadL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's Included Enjoy 1 Evoline ABS Single Chamber Dispenser and 1 pre-filled Clean the World Shampoo. About the Evoline ABS Single Dispenser The Evoline ABS Single Dispenser provides you flexibility and ease. Easily mount 1 or more single dispensers to reduce shower clutter and free up space. Built with hygiene and cleanliness in mind, white ABS plastic provides a modern design, without rusting. The locking feature can either be used in personal homes or rentals. It adds security for rentals, while providing excellent amenities for guests. For homes, it provides additional safety and durability. Mounting Mounting the Evoline ABS Single Dispenser is simple and easy. Clean surface with a normal shower cleaning detergent Clean surface with 50/50 mixture of isopropyl alcohol and water Mark on surface where you want to place the dispenser - using pencil and level Affix chamber to surface Inserting Bottles and Replacements This product comes with 1 shampoo. Simply unlock the chamber with the included key, open chamber, uncap bottle, insert bottle, and re-lock the chamber. **Replacements available on the Gilchrist & Soames Amazon Store. ** About the Clean the World Collection Enliven your senses with the fresh mandarin and California lemon fragrance found in Clean the World products. Antioxidant rich vitamins C and E blend with fresh citrus notes of mandarin, bergamot, and lemon fragrances create an invigorating and uplifting fragrance. The Clean the World Collection features the Gilchrist & Soames� Signature Formulations, which contain no parabens, phthalates, petrol-derived ingredients, mineral oil, urea, DEA, TEA, or propylene glycol. They do contain food-grade, naturally derived USP glycerin and natural conditioning","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aM2qBIadL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gilchrist & Soames","source_asin":"B0B5FJKGD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FJKGD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FJKGD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
