window.products.push({"id":507967,"name":"Hamilton Beach 63222IC 400-Watt Standmixer, Ice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CT1NMWTZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Heavy and substantial, this is one mixer that wont jump around the counter no matter how thick the batter. The weight also means its best to find a countertop storage area, since you wont want to haul it off a shelf every time you want to use it. That said, it mixes beautifully. A 400-watt motor, two-way rotating mixing action, and a choice of three attachments smoothly mix cookie dough (even thick oatmeal chocolate chip dough), produce fluffy piles of whipped cream, knead bread dough, and more. Push the quick-release button to tilt the head back so that the flat beater and dough hook, both durable metal, and the stainless-steel wire whisk can be interchanged. The heavy head locks when its up, so it wont come crashing down. A 4.5-quart stainless-steel bowl with a convenient handle locks into the stainless-steel base with a simple twist. To control splatters and allow easy pouring, a clear plastic two-piece shield fits onto the edge of the bowl. While the mixer indicates 12 speeds (0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12), there are really only six power settings, which should be ample. With Electronic Speed Sensor Control the mixer maintains a constant speed when more flour or other ingredients are added. Measuring 13-1/2 by 14-1/2 by 8, the curvaceous all-metal, die-cast mixer has a clean look that fits any style kitchen and comes with a three-year warranty. The 3-foot cord is not detachable. A spiral-bound users guide includes recipes for using the mixer for everything from hot crab dip to meat loaf to sweet potato pie. Bon appétit! --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CT1NMWTZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00009OLBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-507967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009OLBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009OLBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
